  "description": "AWIVAF crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C64 H60 Ho4 N12 O20,13(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Ho2 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Ho4 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Ho1 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Ho3 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.796-3.934 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 106.40-115.80°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Ho4(LH2)4(μ2-OH)4]·13H2O (C64H60Ho4N12O20·13H2O). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ2-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 4 μ2-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
